{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/102263","id":2310076705,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6JsPkh","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/102263","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/102263.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/102263.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102263","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/102263/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/102263/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102263/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/cb7509259ce231472cd350e90b4d88ba0a7d58a7","number":102263,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Add an option to capture scene thumbnails with fixed view","user":{"login":"daniel080400","id":26960237,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI2OTYwMjM3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/26960237?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel080400","html_url":"https://github.com/daniel080400","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel080400/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel080400/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel080400/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel080400/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel080400/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel080400/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel080400/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel080400/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel080400/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"<!--\r\nPlease target the `master` branch in priority.\r\n\r\nRelevant fixes are cherry-picked for stable branches as needed by maintainers.\r\n\r\nTo speed up the contribution process and avoid CI errors, please set up pre-commit hooks locally:\r\nhttps://docs.godotengine.org/en/latest/contributing/development/code_style_guidelines.html\r\n-->\r\n\r\nAdd a setting ```docks/filesystem/scene_thumbnail_capture_method``` to toggle between **FREE** / **FIXED** thumbnail captures, **FREE** is the default behavior, which captures scene thumbnail by the current camera view. This PR adds a **FIXED** option to always capture scene thumbnails with a 3/4 fixed view (in 3d), also ensures all visual elements are within the capture.\r\n\r\n![scene_thumbnail_fixed](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/4d1b396f-c0cc-4ba2-b9e0-6a7e87bc5f5e)\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/4524f572-d47a-4db9-8fe3-69e24154dcad\r\n\r\nTODO:\r\n - [ ] Set fixed camera zoom / fov when capturing\r\n - [ ] Hide gizmo when capturing thumbnails\r\n - [ ] Exclude node types that are generally not concerned in thumbnails from AABB calculation (light, particles, probes, skeletons, colliders)\r\n - [ ] Implement FIXED thumbnail capturing for 2d scenes\r\n - [ ] Check if performance is okay for large scenes with large number of nodes\r\n\r\n___\r\n\r\n- *Production edit: This partially addresses https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/7232 (3D only).*","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","description":"","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098219,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyMTk=","url":"https://api.github.com